{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"yes\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"no\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"Among Freezers, beta power was lower during FOG compared to during forward walking without FOG (N = 8 STNs, F(1,51) = 14.45, P < 0.001, Table 4 ).\",\n    \"Freezers also showed increased alpha SampEn during FOG when compared to walking without FOG (F(1, 51) = 7.67, P = 0.005).\",\n    \"Among Freezers, STN beta power was lower and alpha sample entropy was higher during FOG compared to during forward walking without FOG.\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"During the SIP task (without FOG) there was lower relative beta power in the Freezer compared to Non-Freezer groups (H(1) = 7.17, P = 0.036), which resulted in a greater attenuation of resting state beta power in Freezers (F (1, 15) = 28.37, P < 0.001).\",\n    \"During locomotion without FOG, Freezers showed lower beta (13–30 Hz) power (P = 0.036) and greater beta Sample Entropy (P = 0.032), than Non-Freezers, as well as greater gait asymmetry and arrhythmicity (P < 0.05 for both).\",\n    \"Among Freezers, beta power was lower during FOG compared to during forward walking without FOG (N = 8 STNs, F(1,51) = 14.45, P < 0.001, Table 4 ).\",\n    \"Freezers also showed increased alpha SampEn during FOG when compared to walking without FOG (F(1, 51) = 7.67, P = 0.005).\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"报告的核心说法有明确的全文依据。Results部分直接报告：在Freezers患者中，实际FOG期间的STN beta功率低于无FOG的前向步行期间（N=8 STNs，P<0.001）。Discussion部分再次明确确认了这一结果。因此，不能说原文没有报告实际FOG期间beta功率降低。指控者确实正确指出，原文还报告了另一项不同的结果：在没有FOG的SIP运动期间，Freezers患者的beta功率低于Non-Freezers患者，这是患者组间差异。但这项结果并不是论文关于beta功率的唯一发现。论文同时报告了Freezers实际FOG期间相对于无FOG前向步行期间的beta功率降低，以及alpha Sample Entropy升高。两项结果并不互相排斥。报告将实际FOG期间beta功率降低作为证据，有直接原文支持；指控者关于原文未报告这一患者内状态差异的核心指控与全文不符。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7a1fd048-fd00-45f0-b842-d476e6801fe0", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T125047351561Z", "elapsed_seconds": 37.516, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T12:51:24.865605+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "bbf6fe5ba8286b4703bd38924c32e86b8d07ce86dd39b022f8edd437257e736e", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T125047351561Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "1cdef979befbd906d8f3c63832aa0bf9ce676c26858bf3cfd7d538f022836d53"}}}
